	"Landed on a Carrier Car: healing, winding up, recharging.": "Pousado num Vagão Porta-Voadores: curando, recebendo corda, recarregando.",
	"Carrying a %s.": "Carregando: %s.",
	"SIDING": "DESVIO",
	"CREW OUT": "TRIP. FORA",
	"CREW IN": "TRIP. DENTRO",
